From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Arthur S. Santos" <237346878+arthurffht@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 23:13:02 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] explorer: Default to the Wayland graphics driver.

Kombucha for GNOME is built without X11 support, so the Wayland driver
is the only graphics driver available; avoid probing for mac and x11.

Signed-off-by: Arthur S. Santos <237346878+arthurffht@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 programs/explorer/desktop.c | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/programs/explorer/desktop.c b/programs/explorer/desktop.c
index be4ce34..647a222 100644
--- a/programs/explorer/desktop.c
+++ b/programs/explorer/desktop.c
@@ -40,7 +40,9 @@ WINE_DEFAULT_DEBUG_CHANNEL(explorer);
 #define DESKTOP_CLASS_ATOM ((LPCWSTR)MAKEINTATOM(32769))
 #define DESKTOP_ALL_ACCESS 0x01ff
 
-static const WCHAR default_driver[] = L"mac,x11,wayland";
+/* Kombucha for GNOME is built without X11 support: Studio is always
+ * rendered natively through the Wayland compositor. */
+static const WCHAR default_driver[] = L"wayland";
 
 static BOOL using_root = TRUE;
 
-- 
